msgstr "Aprovisionar Options"

#: ../../integration_guides/Automation/chef.rst:57
msgid ""
"When provisioning Instances into a Cloud or Group with a Chef Integration"
" added, a `Chef` section will appear in the Config section of the "
"provisioning wizard. By default, Chef is enabled, but can be disabled by "
"expanding the `Chef` section and unchecking `Enable Chef`."
msgstr ""
"When provisioning Instances en un Cloud o Group con un Chef Integration "
"agregado, un `Chef` sección será appear in el Config sección of el "
"provisioning wizard. By predeterminado, Chef es habilitado, pero se puede"
" deshabilitar by expanding el `Chef` sección y unchecking `Enable Chef`."

